//   M = N_batch * OH * OW   (output spatial positions, flattened)
//   N = C_out               (output channels)
//   K = C_in * KH * KW      (reduction dim, gathered from input on the fly)
// C[M,N] tile per CTA: BM x BN, k-chunks of BK staged in shared memory.

